{"id":"aeeeb6862efb50c6","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure.md","title":"thm least adequate lower structure","display":"thm least adequate lower structure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure","aliases":["72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure"],"display":"thm least adequate lower structure","depends_on":["[[72-df-program-envelope]]","[[72-df-four-valued-truth]]","[[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Proposition3.2.4, Corollary3.2.5 and Theorem3.3.3, print652–654/PDF664–666; fixed-base formulation","verification_status":"source-statements-checked; fixed-base proof reviewed","proof_status":"proved-in-note by transfinite iteration and monotonicity","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_2026_10_22":"以显式超限阶段和闭包序数补强最小充分结构的构造依据"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm least adequate lower structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c4d010edfaaea6b\" href=\"?note=6c4d010edfaaea6b\" title=\"72-df-program-envelope\">72-df-program-envelope</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0572b6bbfb593e05\" href=\"?note=0572b6bbfb593e05\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-truth\">72-df-four-valued-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64b08328ac145622\" href=\"?note=64b08328ac145622\" title=\"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization\">72-thm-program-closure-stabilization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Proposition3.2.4, Corollary3.2.5 and Theorem3.3.3, print652–654/PDF664–666; fixed-base formulation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statements-checked; fixed-base proof reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note by transfinite iteration and monotonicity"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"以显式超限阶段和闭包序数补强最小充分结构的构造依据"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c4d010edfaaea6b\" href=\"?note=6c4d010edfaaea6b\" title=\"72-df-program-envelope\">72-df-program-envelope</a> 的D、函数解释、有限程序P、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\Sigma(D),I_P\">\\(K_\\Sigma(D),I_P\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lower}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lower}(M)\\)</span> 指所有R、⃗d的值均不等于c。A为本语言公式，s为D赋值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\models^{D}_{4}A\">\\(P\\models^{D}_{4}A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\models^{D}_{\\rm low}A\">\\(P\\models^{D}_{\\rm low}A\\)</span> 分别量化该固定基底上的全部充分四值、充分lower三值结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=\\mathfrak h(K_\\Sigma(D))\">\\(\\theta=\\mathfrak h(K_\\Sigma(D))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_P\">\\(c_P\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}\">\\(\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64b08328ac145622\" href=\"?note=64b08328ac145622\" title=\"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization\">72-thm-program-closure-stabilization</a> 的同一固定基底实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lower}(M):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\ R^M(\\vec d)\\ne\\mathsf c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Lower}(M):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\ R^M(\\vec d)\\ne\\mathsf c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lower}(I_P)\\land\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to[I_P\\sqsubseteq M\\land\\mathcal E_P(I_P)=I_P]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Lower}(I_P)\\land\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to[I_P\\sqsubseteq M\\land\\mathcal E_P(I_P)=I_P]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP\\models^D_4A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to\\forall s\\ (⟦ A⟧_{M,s})_+=1),\\\\\nP\\models^D_{\\rm low}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\land\\operatorname{Lower}(M)\\to\\forall s\\ (⟦ A⟧_{M,s})_+=1),\\\\\nP\\models^D_4A&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ P\\models^D_{\\rm low}A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP\\models^D_4A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to\\forall s\\ (⟦ A⟧_{M,s})_+=1),\\\\\nP\\models^D_{\\rm low}A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\land\\operatorname{Lower}(M)\\to\\forall s\\ (⟦ A⟧_{M,s})_+=1),\\\\\nP\\models^D_4A&amp;\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ P\\models^D_{\\rm low}A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_P=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(c_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_P=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(c_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从底U迭代E_P，后继取envelope、极限取信息上确界。序列递增；逻辑运算保持lower，递增lower链的上确界仍lower。若一直未稳定，则每个严格后继增加至少一个原子坐标信息位，超过该集合的Hartogs界会矛盾，故某阶段稳定，得到最小不动点I_P且它lower。任一充分M是迭代的上界（超限归纳），所以I_P⊑M。若A在全部lower充分结构真，尤其在I_P第一坐标为1；单调性使它在任意充分M也为1，得非平凡方向，反向由子类包含。对应源书Proposition3.2.4/Corollary3.2.5的固定基底版本；未将基底限制藏入Remark。</p>\n<p>2026-10-22：原来的超限迭代证明现由独立阶段定义、Hartogs稳定论证和lower闭合归纳补齐。显示等式把交集定义与实际迭代值对应起来。原书ω加ω例及其逐阶段计算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"340d363b06fe8470\" href=\"?note=340d363b06fe8470\" title=\"72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega\">72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega</a>；不能无条件以ω阶段替代该构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-program-envelope","status":"resolved","id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-envelope]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0572b6bbfb593e05","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization","status":"resolved","id":"64b08328ac145622","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-envelope","status":"resolved","id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的D、函数解释、有限程序P、$K_\\Sigma(D),I_P$；$\\operatorname{Lower}(M)$ 指所有R、⃗d的值均不等于c。A为本语言公式，s为D赋值。$P\\models^{D}_{4}A$ 与 $P\\models^{D}_{\\rm low}A$ 分别量化该固定基底上的全部充分四值、充分lower三值结构。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization","status":"resolved","id":"64b08328ac145622","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta=\\mathfrak h(K_\\Sigma(D))$、$c_P$ 和 $\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}$ 使用 [[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]] 的同一固定基底实例。","embed":false},{"target":"72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega","status":"resolved","id":"340d363b06fe8470","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"2026-10-22：原来的超限迭代证明现由独立阶段定义、Hartogs稳定论证和lower闭合归纳补齐。显示等式把交集定义与实际迭代值对应起来。原书ω加ω例及其逐阶段计算见 [[72-ex-envelope-closure-omega-plus-omega]]；不能无条件以ω阶段替代该构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K_\\Sigma(D),I_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lower}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\models^{D}_{4}A","display":false},{"tex":"P\\models^{D}_{\\rm low}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta=\\mathfrak h(K_\\Sigma(D))","display":false},{"tex":"c_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lower}(M):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\ R^M(\\vec d)\\ne\\mathsf c.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lower}(I_P)\\land\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to[I_P\\sqsubseteq M\\land\\mathcal E_P(I_P)=I_P]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP\\models^D_4A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to\\forall s\\ (⟦ A⟧_{M,s})_+=1),\\\\\nP\\models^D_{\\rm low}A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\land\\operatorname{Lower}(M)\\to\\forall s\\ (⟦ A⟧_{M,s})_+=1),\\\\\nP\\models^D_4A&\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ P\\models^D_{\\rm low}A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I_P=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(c_P).","display":true}],"bytes":3069,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-367","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure|thm least adequate lower structure]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm least adequate lower structure](72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-393","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure|thm least adequate lower structure]]"},{"id":"92e9c5c40b78fb74","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\vdash_r^{-n}\\Gamma$ 采用 [[72-df-identity-free-program-calculus]] 的有限集合推导；$M_P^{[n]}$ 采用 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]。$M$ 是固定基底 $D$ 上的四值结构，$\\operatorname{Lower}(M)$ 采用 [[72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure]]，$\\operatorname{EqBase}_\\Sigma(M)$ 采用 calculus 的 CET 上游。$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$，$s$ 遍历 $D^V$。"},{"id":"141c93aa59eed1f8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$，$A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$，$\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)$ 和 signed translation 采用 [[72-df-partial-program-completion]]。$\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)$ 是 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 在 $M$ 的自身基底上的前不动点条件；$\\operatorname{Lower}$ 采用 [[72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure]]；$\\vdash^-,\\vdash^-_0$ 采用 [[72-thm-identity-free-cut-elimination]] 的 calculus。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-493","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure]]"}],"outgoing":["6c4d010edfaaea6b","0572b6bbfb593e05","64b08328ac145622","340d363b06fe8470"]}